success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Verify triggers, schema integrity and default partition health

Usage: auditstream verify [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>
          Path to the configuration file (defaults to ./auditstream.toml if present)
          
          [env: AUDITSTREAM_CONFIG=]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (`text` or `json`)

          Possible values:
          - text: Human-readable one-line-per-finding output
          - json: Machine-readable JSON report
          
          [default: text]

      --database-url <URL>
          Postgres connection URL (also reads `DATABASE_URL` as fallback)
          
          [env: AUDITSTREAM_DATABASE_URL]

      --fix
          Create missing monthly partitions 3 months ahead before verifying

      --schema <SCHEMA>
          Audit schema name (defaults to `auditstream`)
          
          [env: AUDITSTREAM_SCHEMA=]

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase log verbosity (`-v` info, `-vv` debug)

  -q, --quiet
          Silence warnings and info logs (errors only)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

----- stderr -----
